<!-- RESONANCE UNIVERSAL IN-PAGE PODCAST PLAYER FOR CARRD         -->
<!-- With In-Page Teen Transcript Drawer & Private Telemetry      -->
<!-- INSTRUCTIONS:                                                -->
<!-- 1. Use ONE Carrd Embed element (delete duplicate embeds).   -->
